{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "groups-formed-by-descent",
  "title": {
    "en": "Groups formed by descent",
    "zh": "由世系形成的组"
  },
  "kind": "theorem",
  "status": "recorded-checked",
  "family": "F01",
  "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-10-20T18:18:37+00:00",
  "statement": {
    "en": "With exact transmission, groups formed by descent from groups uniform in an amount keep their values: nothing is selected within them and selection is among the lineages alone; where the lower lineages end, the mean never falls below where it started.",
    "zh": "传递精确时，由在某量上均匀之组的世系形成的组保持其值：组内无选择，选择只在世系之间；较低世系终止时，均值从不低于起点。"
  },
  "laws": [
    {
      "en": "A group's lineage over listed generations: the group at the first generation and the offspring of its lineage at each later one; the lineages of a generation listed as groups list every later generation.",
      "zh": "组在列出世代中的世系：第一代时即该组，此后每代为其上一代世系的后代；一代列为若干组时，其世系列出此后每一代。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineage",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineages",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.whole_map",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.flatMap_flatMap",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineages_family",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineages_whole",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineage_within"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "With exact transmission every member of a lineage carries the value its group was founded at, so its mean stays there while it has members, and lineages of groups uniform in an amount stay uniform in it.",
      "zh": "传递精确时，世系的每个成员都带有其组建立时的值，故世系有成员时其均值保持不变，在某量上均匀之组的世系保持均匀。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineage_keeps",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineage_value",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineage_total",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineages_uniform"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Nothing is then selected within the lineages, for any weight, and the mean rises across any step exactly where the lineages' means select for the amount: selection among them is all there is.",
      "zh": "此时世系内对任何权重都无选择，均值恰在各世系均值选择该量时上升：世系之间的选择即全部。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.within_by_none_of_uniform",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.rises_iff_means_of_uniform",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.lineages_within_none",
        "Becoming.SelectionLevels.rises_iff_lineages"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "On the base, where at each step the lineages founded lower are not active, nothing is discordant, the mean never falls below where it started over any number of steps, and it rises where a higher lineage leaves offspring beside a lower one.",
      "zh": "在基上，若每一步建立值较低的世系皆不活跃，则无不一致，任意步数后均值不低于起点，较高世系在较低世系旁留下后代时均值上升。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.GroupEnding.Flow.lineages_none_against",
        "Becoming.GroupEnding.Flow.lineages_not_lower",
        "Becoming.GroupEnding.Flow.lineages_raises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Witness: a group holding back and one not, whose members leave nothing; the mean rises from a half to one and stays there, where the mixed groups of Exhausted fell below their start.",
      "zh": "见证：一个保留之组与一个不保留、成员不留后代之组；均值由一半升到一并保持，而 Exhausted 的混合组降到起点以下。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.GroupEnding.Assorted.first_listed",
        "Becoming.GroupEnding.Assorted.uniform",
        "Becoming.GroupEnding.Assorted.kept"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "en": "No axiom. Exact transmission at every step for the lineage laws; on the base, only active formations giving, descent, and as a hypothesis at each step that the members of the lineages founded lower are not active (supplied by the ending laws where their conditions ran into joint excess).",
      "zh": "不加公理。世系定律需每一步传递精确；在基上，需只有活跃的形成给予、世系，以及作为每一步的假设，建立值较低之世系的成员不活跃（其条件遭遇共同过度时由终止定律给出）。"
    }
  ],
  "does_not_show": [
    {
      "en": "Groups founded mixed (assortment below one, relatedness within groups below one), migration between lineages and inexact transmission are not stated; so the share of selection among groups as a function of assortment (Hamilton 1975) is not stated.",
      "zh": "混合建立的组（聚合低于一、组内亲缘低于一）、世系间迁移与不精确的传递未陈述；故组间选择份额作为聚合程度之函数（Hamilton 1975）未陈述。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "Why the lower lineages end: their members not being active is a hypothesis wherever it enters.",
      "zh": "较低世系为何终止：其成员不活跃在出现处都是假设。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "That keeping what ending selected is better: the mean is read in the counts; ranking goes through the comparison C.",
      "zh": "保住终止所选出的更好：均值在计数中读出；排序经由比较 C。",
      "kind": "non-implication"
    }
  ],
  "counterexamples": [
    {
      "path": "experiments/integrated-correction/general-framework/generative-basis/lean/becoming/Becoming/GroupEnding.lean",
      "detail": {
        "en": "Groups formed across lineages need not keep their differences: in Exhausted the next groups are alike in holding back and the mean falls below where it started (Exhausted.next_step), while with the groups formed by descent it stays (Assorted.kept).",
        "zh": "跨世系形成的组不必保持差异：Exhausted 中下一代的组在保留上相同，均值降到起点以下（Exhausted.next_step），而组由世系形成时均值保持（Assorted.kept）。"
      }
    }
  ],
